        "raw": "<p>Deadline&#39;s card is pretty straightforward, and I have to guess that the designers knew the gist of Akash Thriya&#39;s deck when Deadline was created. Until I see&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">&quot;remove the top X </span><u style=\"font-size: 13px;\">environment</u><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"> cards from the environment deck&quot; as errata, she is a pretty effective foil to Deadline.</span></p>",
